abstract: >-
  Meu Artigo is an experimental ChatGPT plugin incorporating a
  scientific-research workflow skill for evidence-grounded article
  preparation, methodological guidance, researcher-controlled
  scientific gates, and provenance-aware research project governance.
  RC.4 is an unpublished candidate and no scientific validation is claimed.

